==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|cu|съзьдати||to build, to erect}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*sъzьdati}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*zьdati}}. The modern conjugation is analogical after {{m|ru|дать}}, replacing the old present stem ''созижд''-.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|созда́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-создать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|созда́ть|pf|impf=создава́ть,созида́ть|vn=созда́ние}}

# to [[create]]
# to [[found]], to [[originate]]
# to [[set up]], to [[establish]]
# {{lb|ru|literary}} to [[build]], to [[erect]]

====Usage notes====
* The imperfectives {{m|ru|создава́ть}} and {{m|ru|созида́ть}} have the same meaning, but the latter is literary or dated.

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|irreg/c(1),c+p|созда́ть|past_m_tail=*|past_pl_tail=*|past_n2=созда́ло*|past_n3=создало́**|notes=* Less common.<br />** Common but non-standard.}}
{{ru-conj|pf|irreg/c(1),c+p|созда́ть|past_m_tail=*|past_pl_tail=*|past_n2=созда́ло*|past_n3=создало́**|notes=* Less common.<br />** Common but non-standard.|old=1}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ru|создава́ться|g=impf}}, {{l|ru|созда́ться|g=pf}}
* {{l|ru|воссозда́ть}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|зда́ние}}
